---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { siteData } from "@/data/site";
import { formatDate } from "@/lib/posts";

const { name, social, legalUpdated } = siteData;
const analyticsOn = Boolean(siteData.analytics.umami.websiteId || siteData.analytics.cloudflare.token);
const analytics = siteData.analytics.umami.websiteId
	? { name: "Umami", policy: "https://umami.is/privacy" }
	: { name: "Cloudflare Web Analytics", policy: "https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" };
const updated = formatDate(new Date(`${legalUpdated}T00:00:00${siteData.timezoneOffset}`));
---

<PageLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Pinoy Techie handles your information: no accounts, no ad or analytics cookies, third-party links, and your rights under the Data Privacy Act."
	lead={`Last updated ${updated}`}
	path="/privacy-policy/"
	dateModified={`${legalUpdated}T00:00:00${siteData.timezoneOffset}`}>
	<p>
		This policy explains what information {name} ("we", "us") collects when you visit pinoytechie.lol, and your rights under the
		Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173).
	</p>

	<h2>The short version</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>You do not need an account, and this site has no sign-up, comment or newsletter forms.</li>
		{
			analyticsOn ? (
				<li>We use a privacy-friendly analytics tool that sets no cookies and is not used to identify you (see "Third-party services").</li>
			) : (
				<li>We do not currently use advertising cookies or analytics tools.</li>
			)
		}
		<li>We do not use advertising cookies.</li>
		<li>We do not sell personal information.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you contact us by email or through YouTube, we receive the details you choose to send,
		such as your name, contact details and message. We use them only to reply and, if relevant, to correct a guide.
	</p>
	<p>
		<strong>Technical data from hosting.</strong> This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may process technical
		data such as your IP address and browser details when your device requests a page. We do not receive this data as personal
		information. See the <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Cookies</h2>
	<p>
		We do not set cookies ourselves{analyticsOn && ", and our analytics tool does not use cookies either"}. Fonts are served from this site, not from Google Fonts. Embedded videos can set cookies only if you play
		them (see below).
	</p>

	<h2>Third-party services</h2>
	<ul>
		{
			analyticsOn && (
				<li>
					<strong>Analytics ({analytics.name}).</strong> We count visits in aggregate: which pages are read, where visitors come from, the browser and
					device type, and the approximate country. It uses no cookies, we do not use it to identify you, and it respects your browser's "Do Not
					Track" setting where the tool supports it. See the <a href={analytics.policy} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{analytics.name} privacy policy</a>.
				</li>
			)
		}
		<li>
			<strong>Site search.</strong> Search runs in your browser, using an index that is built with the site. The words you search for are not
			sent to us or to any other party.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>YouTube.</strong> Our videos are embedded using YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode (youtube-nocookie.com). When you play a video,
			Google may collect data about your viewing under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>YouTube API Services.</strong> This site uses YouTube API Services to list our public videos and Shorts and show their titles and
			view counts. This happens when the site is built, not in your browser, and it involves no personal data about visitors. By using this site you
			are also subject to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YouTube Terms of Service</a>, and
			Google's handling of data is described in the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Links to other sites.</strong> We link to MariBank, Google Play, the Apple App Store and other sites. Their privacy practices
			are theirs, so read their policies before you share personal or financial details.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>{analyticsOn ? "If we add advertising in future" : "If we add analytics or advertising in future"}, we will update this page before we do.</p>

	<h2>Your referral code and your bank details</h2>
	<p>
		Copying the referral code happens in your browser only. We never ask for your MariBank login, OTP, PIN, card number or password.
		Never share those with anyone, including us.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>Under the Data Privacy Act you have the right to be informed, to access, to object, to correct, to request erasure or blocking, to data portability, and to claim damages
		where applicable. To exercise a right regarding information you sent us, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the
		<a href="https://privacy.gov.ph" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">National Privacy Commission</a>.</p>

	<h2>Children</h2>
	<p>This site is not directed at children. Opening a bank account generally requires being of legal age.</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		{
			social.email ? (
				<>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${social.email}`}>{social.email}</a>.</>
			) : (
				<>Questions about this policy: use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</>
			)
		}
	</p>
</PageLayout>
